# Logic Building Assignment 3

## Description
This assignment contains five C programming problems
designed to strengthen logical thinking, iteration,
conditional statements, and function implementation.

## Programs

1. Print the first N even numbers.
2. Display all factors of a given number.
3. Display even factors of a given number.
4. Convert uppercase characters to lowercase and vice versa.
5. Check whether a character is a vowel.

## Concepts Covered
- Functions
- Loops
- Conditional Statements
- Modulus Operator
- Character Manipulation
- Boolean Logic

## Programming Language
C

